BALL        W/S/A/D push (camera relative)  SPACE stop
CAMERA      C cycle Free/Orbit/Follow   F focus+orbit selected   Home reset
            Free:  arrows move, PgUp/PgDn up/down, right-drag look, scroll = zoom (FOV)
            Orbit: right-drag or arrows rotate, scroll/PgUp/PgDn distance, middle-drag pan
            Numpad 1/3/7 (or Ctrl+1/3/7) front/side/top view
EDIT MODE   Tab toggle   T op (Translate/Rotate/Scale/Shear)   J/L X  U/O Y  I/K Z
            Ctrl = uniform scale   M mirror (reflect)   Backspace reset   Shift faster
RENDER      F1 wireframe  F2 shading (Flat/Gouraud/Phong/Blinn)  F3 textures
            F4 RAY TRACING  (-/= resolution, Ctrl+9 bounces)
            F5 ambient  F6 diffuse  F7 specular  F8 sun/moon light
            F9 normals  F10 vertices  F11 axes gizmo  F12 screenshot (BMP)
            V list parts of selected object, Shift+V dump vertex/index tables
WORLD       P pause clock  [ ] time speed  , . scrub time  N manual/progression  Shift+N replay
            H on-screen guide  G interface  B rebuild blocks  Ctrl+B select block  Esc quit
STORY       Outside -> 257 -> toy chest -> Buzz's room -> wardrobe -> laser -> morning
